Howard depicted the Conan universe as maybe between Atlantis
and before recorded civilization or maybe a paralell universe.  Since
the Conan tales spanned the Eurasian land mass and since the
universe is parallel, Howard drew from different cultures.  Those
names do come from the nations on the Conan world map that
are about the same place as in this world - Crom is known in
Cimeria (maybe Scandinavia maybe Iceland), Mithras in Persia,
Set in Egypt.



